1
00:00:00,343 --> 00:00:02,433
(Raj:)Wool pants in the desert.

2
00:00:02,645 --> 00:00:05,475
(Raj:)I feel like I've got poached testicles.

3
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:09,610
(Leonard:)Oh, you poor thing, you're sweating.

4
00:00:09,819 --> 00:00:12,309
(Leonard:)That's so much worse
than having your car stolen.

5
00:00:12,522 --> 00:00:17,292
(Raj:)Insurance is gonna buy you a new car.
It's not gonna de-funk my junk.

6
00:00:18,327 --> 00:00:21,627
(Sheldon:)Gentlemen, a little less bellyaching.

7
00:00:21,831 --> 00:00:25,291
(Sheldon:)We're Starfleet officers
and a member of the Borg Collective.

8
00:00:25,501 --> 00:00:28,301
(Leonard:)Please, Sheldon, I am so not in the mood.

9
00:00:28,504 --> 00:00:30,094
(Sheldon:)Leonard...

10
00:00:30,306 --> 00:00:33,336
(Sheldon:)...all our lives
we have dreamed of finding ourselves...

11
00:00:33,543 --> 00:00:35,973
(Sheldon:)...inside one of the fantasy worlds
we love.

12
00:00:36,479 --> 00:00:37,999
(Sheldon:)And look at us.

13
00:00:38,214 --> 00:00:41,984
(Sheldon:)At this moment, we are, in fact,
a Star Trek landing party...

14
00:00:42,185 --> 00:00:45,675
(Sheldon:)...stranded in an alien
and unforgiving environment.

15
00:00:46,222 --> 00:00:50,182
(Sheldon:)Relying only on our wits,
our fortitude and our moxie.

16
00:00:50,693 --> 00:00:52,663
(Sheldon:)As long as we have those things...

17
00:00:52,862 --> 00:01:01,022
- ...nothing can stop us...
- Nerds!

